---
import Layout from '@/components/Layout.astro';

const meta = {
  title: 'From Dominion to Harmony — Earthsong',
  description: 'Earthsong’s public framework for stewardship through kinship—principles, practice, and a 12-month plan anyone can adopt.',
};

const principles = [
  { num: '01', title: 'Reverence', body: 'Treat land, waters, and creatures as worthy of honor—not use alone.' },
  { num: '02', title: 'Reciprocity', body: 'Take with care, give back with intention, and keep the exchange visible.' },
  { num: '03', title: 'Responsibility', body: 'Match love with measurable action and shared accountability.' },
  { num: '04', title: 'Repair', body: 'Where harm was done, restore habitats, soils, waters, and trust.' },
];

const practices = [
  {
    num: '01',
    title: 'Reflection',
    items: ['Seasonal blessings for waters and trees.', 'Sabbath-for-the-land pauses in gardens or parks.', 'Gratitude circles that name one local species to protect.'],
  },
  {
    num: '02',
    title: 'Learning',
    items: ['Primers on soils, watersheds, native species, and pollution.', 'Study groups pairing classic teachings with present-day ecology.', 'Practical energy workshops for homes and community buildings.'],
  },
  {
    num: '03',
    title: 'Service',
    items: ['River and stream cleanups; native plantings and pollinator plots.', 'Habitat days, invasive removal, and trail care.', 'Food rescue and gleaning networks that reduce waste.'],
  },
  {
    num: '04',
    title: 'Commons',
    items: ['Energy audits and retrofit drives for shared buildings.', 'Local advocacy for tree canopy, clean water, and transit access.', 'Shared purchasing that cuts packaging and harmful inputs.'],
  },
];

const goals = [
  { num: '10+', label: 'shared service days' },
  { num: '5,000', label: 'native plants established' },
  { num: '1,000', label: 'volunteer hours' },
  { num: '−10%', label: 'energy use across buildings' },
];

const steps = [
  'Host a 60-minute Harmony Circle with the free guide.',
  'Sponsor one native-plant bed or pollinator patch.',
  'Adopt a one-mile waterway with quarterly care.',
  'Complete a basic energy checklist and choose one retrofit.',
  'For each new purchase, make one act of repair or reuse.',
];

const faqs = [
  { q: 'Is this anti-human?', a: 'No. It dignifies people and place. Stewardship through kinship benefits human life, too.' },
  { q: 'Is this political?', a: 'It is ethical and practical. We welcome anyone willing to work for clean air, water, soil, and community well-being.' },
  { q: 'Do I need a specific faith?', a: 'No. Earthsong convenes across traditions and welcomes the non-religious. The work is shared.' },
];
---

<Layout title={meta.title} description={meta.description} fullWidth>
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-forest text-chalk">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/leaf-texture.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-10"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-ink/70 via-forest/80 to-forest/30"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-32 h-[32rem] w-[32rem] rounded-full border border-mist/10"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute right-8 top-4 h-72 w-72 rounded-full border border-ember/25"></div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-ember-light">A public stewardship framework</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-5xl font-display text-[clamp(4.25rem,10vw,8.5rem)] uppercase leading-[0.82] tracking-[0.055em]">
        From Dominion<br />to Harmony
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl font-body text-lg leading-relaxed text-mist/80 md:text-xl">
        A shared calling: stewardship through kinship. Practical, measurable, and open to all traditions—and none.
      </p>
      <nav aria-label="On this page" class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a href="#principles" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-mist/25 px-4 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors hover:border-ember-light hover:text-ember-light">Principles</a>
        <a href="#practice" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-mist/25 px-4 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors hover:border-ember-light hover:text-ember-light">Practice</a>
        <a href="#goals" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-mist/25 px-4 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors hover:border-ember-light hover:text-ember-light">12-month goals</a>
        <a href="#start-here" class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-full border border-mist/25 px-4 font-mono text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] transition-colors hover:border-ember-light hover:text-ember-light">Start here</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-b border-ink/10 bg-chalk">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-dark">Why this matters</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase leading-[0.94] tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">Ethics become visible through action.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 font-body text-base leading-[1.85] text-stone md:text-lg">
        <p>Across many traditions, humans are called to care for the world. Earthsong reads that calling as a both/and: our uniquely human moral agency is expressed through reverent kinship with the living world.</p>
        <p>The ecological crisis is not only technical—it is ethical. When our stories honor the more-than-human world, our choices follow: what we build, how we consume, and who thrives from it. Harmony is ethics in action.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="principles" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-chalk">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div class="border-b border-ink/15 pb-6">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-dark">Four commitments</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">The principles</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {principles.map((principle) => (
          <article class="border-b border-ink/15 py-8 md:border-r md:px-6 md:first:pl-0 lg:border-b-0 lg:last:border-r-0 lg:last:pr-0">
            <span class="font-mono text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.13em] text-ember-dark">{principle.num}</span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">{principle.title}</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 font-body text-sm leading-[1.75] text-stone">{principle.body}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-moss/5">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-12 sm:px-6 md:py-16 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-lg border border-moss/20 bg-white/60 p-6 shadow-field md:grid-cols-[220px_1fr] md:p-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.05em] text-moss">Ancient texts,<br />modern readings</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-sm leading-[1.8] text-stone">Earthsong draws inspiration from long-standing teachings on caretaking—Sabbath for the land, tending gardens, gleaning, and mercy for creatures. We make no claim these sources were written as modern policy; we choose to read them today as a life-giving ethic for the world we share.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="practice" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-chalk">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-dark">Turn belief into practice</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">The practice framework</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-stone">Four overlapping forms of participation keep reflection connected to the places and people it is meant to serve.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-ink/15 md:grid-cols-2">
        {practices.map((practice) => (
          <article class="bg-white/65 p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <h3 class="font-display text-4xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">{practice.title}</h3>
              <span class="font-mono text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.13em] text-ember-dark">{practice.num}</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-3">
              {practice.items.map((item) => (
                <li class="grid grid-cols-[10px_1fr] gap-3 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">
                  <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ember"></span>
                  <span>{item}</span>
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="goals" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-ink text-chalk">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.3fr] md:items-end">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-light">One shared year</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase leading-none tracking-[0.05em]">12-month goals</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist/65">An ethic becomes credible when the work can be seen, counted, learned from, and improved.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-10 grid gap-px bg-mist/15 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
        {goals.map((goal) => (
          <div class="bg-ink p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="font-display text-6xl tracking-[0.03em] text-ember">{goal.num}</div>
            <div class="mt-2 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.13em] text-mist/60">{goal.label}</div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="start-here" class="scroll-mt-24 texture-paper">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[.65fr_1.35fr]">
        <div>
          <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-dark">Begin where you are</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">Start here</h2>
          <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-relaxed text-stone">Choose one action that can be repeated. Rhythm matters more than spectacle.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="border-t border-ink/15">
          {steps.map((step, index) => (
            <li class="grid grid-cols-[44px_1fr] gap-4 border-b border-ink/15 py-5">
              <span class="font-mono text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.13em] text-ember-dark">0{index + 1}</span>
              <span class="font-body text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">{step}</span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-24 border-t border-ink/10 bg-chalk">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ember-dark">Common questions</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">Open ground</h2>
      <div class="mt-9 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-ink/15 md:grid-cols-3">
        {faqs.map((item) => (
          <article class="bg-white/65 p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl uppercase tracking-[0.05em] text-ink">{item.q}</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 font-body text-sm leading-[1.75] text-stone">{item.a}</p>
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl font-body text-xs italic leading-relaxed text-stone">This page keeps advanced or esoteric practices private by default. Deeper materials are shared only with context and consent.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
